          <%= user.aboutMe %>
        <% } else { %>
          A heart that believes in magic, connection, and the little sparks that make life beautiful. I wander through the world with curiosity and an open soul, always drawn to moments that make me smile, laugh, or feel deeply. I’m a dreamer at heart — cherishing sunsets, long conversations, and the quiet warmth of shared moments. Love, in all its forms, inspires me to be kind, patient, and endlessly hopeful. I thrive on genuine connections, sweet surprises, and the joy of discovering beauty in the ordinary. Life feels like a story waiting to be written, and I embrace it with a tender heart, a little bit of courage, and a lot of hope that every day brings a chance to love and be loved. 💖🌹
